# ── Public repo scope ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The published GitHub repo must contain ONLY the add-on package (everything that
# ships inside the extension .zip: sculptools_palette/). Everything below is kept
# LOCALLY for development but is never committed / pushed:
#   - marketing / promotional material (store listings, launch posts, promo assets)
#   - project docs & AI-assistant context / dev handoff
#   - the dev-only validation harness and icon-generation scripts
#   - built release artifacts (distributed via GitHub Releases / extensions.blender.org)
/docs/
/sculptools_validation/
/releases/
/dev_*.py
CLAUDE.md
STORE_LISTING.md
sculptools_handoff.md
